  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Replaced the blanket `kind != Kind::Mill` refusal in `setup_align::generation_problem` with a per-machine capability matrix (`verified_for_machine`).\n- Enabled aligned-setup generation for all 12 turning kinds and `Drill` on `Kind::Lathe`, the 17 verified mill kinds plus all 12 turning kinds on `Kind::MillTurn`, `PlasmaProfile` on `Kind::Plasma`, `WireContour` on `Kind::WireEdm`, and `SinkerBurn` / `SinkerSideBurn` on `Kind::SinkerEdm`.\n- Kept aligned-setup refusals active for `Kind::Waterjet`, unverified foreign operations on non-mill machines (naming that machine kind), `Probe`, 5-axis/rotary kinds, and `tilt().is_some()`.\n- Routed 4-axis ruled wire picks in `operation::wire_ruled` through `setup_align::pose_in` using `op.setup`.\n- Routed cavity electrode derivation (`operation::sinker_faces`, `pick::align::outward_normal`) through `setup_align::pose_in` and `facets_in`.\n- Added `ElectrodeFromFaces::new_in` and updated MCP `electrode_from_faces` to forward an explicit setup name when given.\n- Updated `an_aligned_setup_on_an_edm_names_the_edm_kind_it_is_refused_on` in `setup_align.rs` to assert the per-machine unverified-op refusal on EDM while leaving the machine-level refusal with `Waterjet`.\n- Added equivalence suites `setup_align_lathe.rs`, `setup_align_mill_turn.rs`, and `setup_align_non_mill.rs` plus `docs/decisions/2287-aligned-non-mill-machines.md`. (Fork synced at v0.20.0; branched from `upstream/main`.)\n\n## Cause\n\n`setup_align::generation_problem` rejected every machine kind other than `Kind::Mill` at the gate before operation generation ran. Two document-frame geometry reads also bypassed the setup alignment transform: 4-axis wire profile picks in `wire_ruled.rs` and cavity electrode derivation in `sinker_faces.rs` (including the MCP explicit `setup` parameter).\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins (red before fix -> green after fix):\n  - `setup_align_lathe`: `lathe_facing_rough_finish_chamfer_and_axial_drill_match_baked`, `lathe_groove_part_thread_taper_multipass_form_and_bore_match_baked`, `lathe_op20_flip_and_cross_drill_detect_holes_in_setup_frame` (3/3 red -> 3/3 passed).\n  - `setup_align_mill_turn`: `mill_turn_turning_and_cross_drill_match_baked`, `mill_turn_milling_ops_match_baked_while_probe_5axis_and_tilt_stay_refused` (2/2 red -> 2/2 passed).\n  - `setup_align_non_mill`: `plasma_cuts_the_turned_plate_like_its_baked_twin`, `wire_edm_2axis_and_4axis_ruled_cut_like_baked`, `sinker_electrode_burn_and_side_burn_match_baked`, `waterjet_still_refuses_an_aligned_setup_by_name` (3/4 red + waterjet refusal ok -> 4/4 passed).\n  - `setup_align` (10/10 passed) and `sinker_electrode_mcp` (2/2 passed).\n- Mutations (revert production file -> red, restore -> green):\n  - Reverting `setup_align.rs` failed `setup_align::an_aligned_setup_on_an_edm_names_the_edm_kind_it_is_refused_on`, all 3 `setup_align_lathe` tests, both `setup_align_mill_turn` tests, and the 3 Plasma/EDM `setup_align_non_mill` tests; restoring made all 21 pass.\n  - Reverting `operation/wire_ruled.rs` failed `wire_edm_2axis_and_4axis_ruled_cut_like_baked`; restoring made all 21 pass.\n  - Reverting `operation/sinker_faces.rs`, `commands/electrode.rs`, and `mcp/sinker_tools.rs` failed `sinker_electrode_burn_and_side_burn_match_baked`; restoring made all 21 pass.\n- Checks after the final edit:\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: 0 warnings.\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 29 steps, 0 failed (`app:lib` and all 27 affected integration suites).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Full `cargo xtask gate` beyond `gate quick --base upstream/main`.\n- Interactive GUI rendering and viewport mouse picking.\n- `Kind::Waterjet`, `Probe`, 5-axis/rotary kinds, and tilted ops in aligned setups (beyond verifying they remain refused).\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nChangelog: Accept part alignment on verified Lathe, MillTurn, Plasma, WireEdm and SinkerEdm operations (#2287)\n\nFixes #2287\n",
